  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a reader, I want « Message cité N fois » shown as a small **bubble with the count**, as in legacy, rather than a line of text. A tap shows a **filtered view of only the messages that quoted this one**, so I can follow a discussion without scrolling. (Operator feedback, 2026-11-17, device screenshots of SwiftHFR and legacy.)\n\n### Observed\n\n- SwiftHFR shows a text line « Message cité 1 fois » under the message (`App/SwiftHFR/Reader/TopicHTMLBuilder.swift:224`).\n- Legacy shows a speech-bubble with the count at the right of the message footer:\n  - `LinkItem.m:237-238` @ 87fe0d1c renders `<a class=\"quotedhfrlink\" href=\"quotedLINK\">N</a>`;\n  - its style is in `SuperHFRplus/Assets/HTML/style-liste-*.css` (e.g. `style-liste-dark.css:458, 510`; `style-liste-light.css:444, 510`; the retina sheets at `:59-63`).\n- The count and link are parsed in `ParseMessagesOperation.m:254-257`: the regex `Message cité ([^<]+) fois` and the `href` of the edited node's link.\n\n### Scope\n\n1. **Bubble:** render the count as a bubble at the right of the message footer, with legacy's position and shape. A light tweak of the shape is allowed (operator); the PR says what changed. It must be readable in every theme and keep a 44 pt tap target.\n2. **Tap:** open a **filtered view of the messages that quoted this one**.\n   - Reuse the filtered-posts flow (LOT-093, `App/SwiftHFR/FilteredPosts/`) if it can take this message as its filter. Otherwise follow the link HFR gives (`quotedLINK`) and show the result as a filtered reader.\n   - Record the URL and answer shape you rely on in `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md`, from the legacy code or a capture. If neither covers what that link returns, **stop and open a capture issue** (`host: mac`) instead of guessing (AGENTS.md §3.1). Related open capture: #126 (`quote_only=1`).\n3. Accessibility label « Message cité N fois ».\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- HTML tests: a bubble element carries the count and the link, and the old text line is gone.\n- A tap test: the filtered view is asked for this message's quoting posts.\n- Tests fail without the change.\n- A `### Ledger` entry (a parity fix, citing `LinkItem.m:237-238`).\n\n### Device check (for the #893 general review)\n\nThe message from the screenshot shows the « 1 » bubble; a tap lists Kabrice's reply only.\n\n### Blocked by\n\n#126\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
