   "body": "Draft PR #1040 ships the count bubble only (`Refs #1039`). The tap is **not** done: where legacy's `quotedLINK` (`quote_only=1`) leads is in neither the legacy code nor any fixture (HFR-PROTOCOL §7 E2 / B11, third-party source only), and LOT-093's filtered flow filters by count/pseudo, not by message. Per AGENTS.md §3.1 I did not guess. The capture is already open as #126 (`host: mac`). The tap, its protocol entry and its test follow once #126 lands.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
